    Small (24dp) account-source icon for the per-RawContact chip
    that Contacts apps (Fossify, AOSP Contacts) render next to each
    linked account in the contact-detail view. Pointing
    authenticator.xml#smallIcon at the launcher mipmap causes
    Fossify to fall back to a generic silhouette because mipmap
    launchers are too large for the chip surface; this drawable
    is the dedicated 24dp asset for that surface.

    Glyph: Material-style account_circle (circle + person
    silhouette), filled with the pcontacts brand purple-blue
    that approximates the launcher gradient's mid-tone.
-->
